Package: keyswap
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3,
 python3-evdev
Description: user-level keyboard substitution daemon using evdev and uinput
 Keyswap listens to configured or automatically discovered keyboard
 devices, detects configured key combinations, and injects replacement
 text through uinput.
 .
 It is intended to run as a per-user systemd service with a user-owned
 configuration file and a fallback system configuration.
